- **D1 �?" REFINE [READ/DERIVED]:** Adopt CSR3 only, preferably **Form A**. Give **A1.1 the greatest weight** because the Am7990�?Ts own manual directly specifies CSR3 read-zero. MAME corroborates preserving CSR1/CSR2 but does not prove silicon behavior. Unverified caller identities do not block this narrow change: both supplied chip manuals agree on CSR3.
- **D2 �?" OVERTURN [DERIVED]:** The quoted rules do not automatically turn constant AND into a floor predicate. Kept/dropped partitions bit positions; a written value can contain both. Classify this coverage under clause (e), without extending R5 implicitly.
